#: views/inventory.py:374
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Get paginated stock movement history for a specific product.\n"
"    Supports filtering by variant, warehouse, movement type, and date range.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    **Required:** `product_id` query parameter\n"
"\n"
"    **Movement Types:** adjustment, allocation, fulfillment, return, transfer, damage, recount\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Obtenir l'historique des mouvements de stock paginé pour un produit spécifique.\n"
"Permet le filtrage par variante, entrepôt, type de mouvement et plage de dates.\n"
"\n"
"**Limite de taux :** 300 demandes par minute\n"
"\n"
"**Requis :** paramètre de requête `product_id`\n"
"\n"
"**Types de mouvements :** ajustement, allocation, livraison, retour, transfert, dommage, recomptage\n"
"    "

