#: views/inventory.py:567
#| msgid "Failed to retrieve top products."
msgid "Failed to retrieve stock movements."
msgstr "Échec de la récupération des mouvements de stock."

#: views/inventory.py:582
#| msgid "Get order details"
msgid "Get reorder suggestions"
msgstr "Obtenir des suggestions de réapprovisionnement"

#: views/inventory.py:583
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Get products that need reordering based on sales velocity, lead time,\n"
"    and safety stock calculations.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    **Urgency Levels:**\n"
"    - `immediate`: Less than 7 days of supply remaining\n"
"    - `soon`: 7-14 days of supply remaining\n"
"    - `upcoming`: 14-30 days of supply remaining\n"
"\n"
"    **Reorder Formula:**\n"
"    `suggested_qty = velocity * (lead_days + safety_multiplier * lead_days) - current_stock`\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Obtenir les produits nécessitant un réapprovisionnement en fonction de la vitesse de vente, du délai de livraison\n"
"et des calculs de stock de sécurité.\n"
"\n"
"**Limite de taux :** 300 demandes par minute\n"
"\n"
"**Niveaux d'urgence :**\n"
"- `immédiat` : Moins de 7 jours de stock restants\n"
"- `prochain` : 7 à 14 jours de stock restants\n"
"- `à venir` : 14 à 30 jours de stock restants\n"
"\n"
"**Formule de réapprovisionnement :**\n"
"`suggested_qty = velocity * (lead_days + safety_multiplier * lead_days) - current_stock`\n"
"    "

#: views/inventory.py:618
msgid "Sort field: urgency, -urgency, name, -name"
msgstr "Champ de tri : urgency, -urgency, name, -name"

#: views/inventory.py:626
