#: views/messages.py:272
msgid "List customer messages"
msgstr "Liste des messages du client"

#: views/messages.py:273
#| msgid ""
#| "\n"
#| "    Get a paginated list of customer messages from all sources.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Sources:**\n"
#| "    - `contact_form`: Messages from contact form submissions\n"
#| "    - `order_note`: Customer notes attached to orders\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    Messages are sorted by newest first by default.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Deep Linking:**\n"
#| "    - For `source='contact_form'`: Use `message_id` to navigate to message detail\n"
#| "    - For `source='order_note'`: Use `order_number` to navigate to order detail\n"
#| "    "
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Get a paginated list of customer messages from all sources.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    **Sources:**\n"
"    - `contact_form`: Messages from contact form submissions\n"
"    - `order_note`: Customer notes attached to orders\n"
"\n"
"    Messages are sorted by latest activity by default (most recent reply or creation time).\n"
"\n"
"    **Deep Linking:**\n"
"    - For `source='contact_form'`: Use `message_id` to navigate to message detail\n"
"    - For `source='order_note'`: Use `order_number` to navigate to order detail\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Obtenir une liste paginée des messages clients provenant de toutes les sources.\n"
"\n"
"**Limite de taux :** 300 demandes par minute\n"
"\n"
"**Sources :**\n"
"- `contact_form` : Messages provenant des soumissions de formulaires de contact\n"
"- `order_note` : Notes clients attachées aux commandes\n"
"\n"
"Les messages sont triés par activité la plus récente par défaut (dernière réponse ou heure de création).\n"
"\n"
"**Lien profond :**\n"
"- Pour `source='contact_form'` : Utilisez `message_id` pour accéder aux détails du message\n"
"- Pour `source='order_note'` : Utilisez `order_number` pour accéder aux détails de la commande\n"
"    "

#: views/messages.py:293
msgid "Filter by source: 'all', 'contact_form', 'order_note'"
msgstr "Filtrer par source : 'all', 'contact_form', 'order_note'"

#: views/messages.py:301
msgid "Filter by status: 'all', 'unread', 'read', 'replied', 'archived'"
msgstr "Filtrer par statut : 'all', 'unread', 'read', 'replied', 'archived'"

#: views/messages.py:309
msgid "Search by sender name, email, or subject"
msgstr "Rechercher par nom de l'expéditeur, e-mail ou sujet"

#: views/messages.py:317
msgid ""
"Sort order: '-activity' (latest activity, default), '-created_at' (newest), "
"'created_at' (oldest), 'status' (group by status)"
msgstr ""
"Ordre de tri : '-activity' (activité la plus récente, par défaut), "
"'-created_at' (plus récent), 'created_at' (plus ancien), 'status' (grouper "
"par statut)"

#: views/messages.py:479
msgid "Get message details"
msgstr "Obtenir les détails du message"

#: views/messages.py:480
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Get full details of a customer message.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    **URL Format:** `/messages/{source}/{id}/`\n"
"    - `source`: Either 'contact_form' or 'order_note'\n"
"    - `id`: The message ID within that source\n"
"\n"
"    Automatically marks the message as read if it was unread.\n"
"\n"
"    **Deep Linking:**\n"
"    - For `source='contact_form'`: Returns full contact form message\n"
"    - For `source='order_note'`: Returns order note with order info for linking\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Obtenir les détails complets d'un message du client.\n"
"\n"
"**Limitation de taux :** 300 requêtes par minute\n"
"\n"
"**Format d'URL :** `/messages/{source}/{id}/`\n"
"- `source` : Soit 'contact_form' soit 'order_note'\n"
"- `id` : L'ID du message dans cette source\n"
"\n"
"Marque automatiquement le message comme lu s'il était non lu.\n"
"\n"
"**Liens profonds :**\n"
"- Pour `source='contact_form'` : Retourne le message complet du formulaire de contact\n"
"- Pour `source='order_note'` : Retourne la note de commande avec les informations de commande pour le lien\n"
"    "

#: views/messages.py:529 views/messages.py:557 views/messages.py:661
#: views/messages.py:691 views/messages.py:968
msgid "Message not found."
msgstr "Message non trouvé."

#: views/messages.py:580 views/messages.py:724
msgid "Invalid source. Must be \"contact_form\" or \"order_note\"."
msgstr "Source invalide. Doit être \"contact_form\" ou \"order_note\"."

#: views/messages.py:599
msgid "Update message status"
msgstr "Mettre à jour le statut du message"

#: views/messages.py:600
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Update the status of a customer message.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    **URL Format:** `/messages/{source}/{id}/status/`\n"
"    - `source`: Either 'contact_form' or 'order_note'\n"
"    - `id`: The message ID within that source\n"
"\n"
"    **Status Options:**\n"
"    - read: Mark as read\n"
"    - replied: Mark as replied (contact_form only)\n"
"    - archived: Archive the message (contact_form only)\n"
"\n"
"    Note: OrderNotes only support 'read' status.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Mettre à jour le statut d'un message du client.\n"
"\n"
"**Limite de taux :** 300 requêtes par minute\n"
"\n"
"**Format d'URL :** `/messages/{source}/{id}/status/`\n"
"- `source` : Soit 'contact_form' soit 'order_note'\n"
"- `id` : L'ID du message dans cette source\n"
"\n"
"**Options de statut :**\n"
"- read : Marquer comme lu\n"
"- replied : Marquer comme répondu (uniquement pour contact_form)\n"
"- archived : Archiver le message (uniquement pour contact_form)\n"
"\n"
"Note : Les OrderNotes ne prennent en charge que le statut 'read'.\n"
"    "

#: views/messages.py:642 views/orders.py:514 views/products.py:574
msgid "Invalid status update."
msgstr "Mise à jour de statut invalide."

#: views/messages.py:705
msgid "Order notes only support \"read\" status."
msgstr "Les notes de commande ne prennent en charge que le statut \"read\"."

#: views/messages.py:741
msgid "Message status updated successfully."
msgstr "Statut du message mis à jour avec succès."

#: views/messages.py:750
msgid "Get unread message count"
msgstr "Obtenir le nombre de messages non lus"

#: views/messages.py:751
#| msgid ""
#| "\n"
#| "    Get the count of unread customer messages from all sources.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    Useful for badge display in the app.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    Returns breakdown by source:\n"
#| "    - `contact_form`: Unread contact form submissions\n"
#| "    - `order_note`: Unread customer notes on orders\n"
#| "    - `total`: Combined total\n"
#| "    "
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Get the count of unread customer messages for the current user.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    Useful for badge display in the app. Counts are per-user — a message\n"
"    is \"unread\" if the current staff member has not read it yet, regardless\n"
"    of whether other staff members have.\n"
"\n"
"    Returns breakdown by source:\n"
"    - `contact_form`: Unread contact form submissions for this user\n"
"    - `order_note`: Unread customer notes on orders for this user\n"
"    - `total`: Combined total\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Obtenir le nombre de messages clients non lus pour l'utilisateur actuel.\n"
"\n"
"**Limite de taux :** 300 requêtes par minute\n"
"\n"
"Utile pour l'affichage d'un badge dans l'application. Les comptes sont par utilisateur — un message\n"
"est \"non lu\" si l'utilisateur actuel n'a pas encore lu, indépendamment du fait que d'autres employés l'aient lu.\n"
"\n"
"Retourne une décomposition par source :\n"
"- `contact_form` : Soumissions de formulaire de contact non lues pour cet utilisateur\n"
"- `order_note` : Notes clients non lues sur les commandes pour cet utilisateur\n"
"- `total` : Total combiné\n"
"    "

#: views/messages.py:819
msgid "Get message counts by status"
msgstr "Obtenir les comptes de messages par statut"

#: views/messages.py:820
#| msgid ""
#| "\n"
#| "    Get count of messages by status and source for badge display.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    Returns counts for both sources:\n"
#| "    - `contact_form`: Full status breakdown (unread, read, replied, archived)\n"
#| "    - `order_note`: Simple status (unread, read)\n"
#| "    "
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Get count of messages by status and source for badge display.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    The `unread_by_me` field shows messages the current user has not read,\n"
"    regardless of the message's global status.\n"
"\n"
"    Returns counts for both sources:\n"
"    - `contact_form`: Full status breakdown (unread, read, replied, archived)\n"
"    - `order_note`: Simple status (unread, read)\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Obtenir le nombre de messages par statut et source pour l'affichage d'un badge.\n"
"\n"
"**Limite de taux :** 300 requêtes par minute\n"
"\n"
"Le champ `unread_by_me` affiche les messages que l'utilisateur actuel n'a pas encore lus,\n"
"indépendamment du statut global du message.\n"
"\n"
"Retourne les comptes pour les deux sources :\n"
"- `contact_form` : Décomposition complète du statut (non lu, lu, répondu, archivé)\n"
"- `order_note` : Statut simple (non lu, lu)\n"
"    "

#: views/messages.py:908
msgid "Reply to customer message"
msgstr "Répondre au message du client"

#: views/messages.py:909
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Reply to a customer message from the contact form.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    **URL Format:** `/messages/contact_form/{id}/reply/`\n"
"\n"
"    This endpoint:\n"
"    1. Stores the reply text against the message\n"
"    2. Updates message status to 'replied'\n"
"    3. Optionally sends an email to the customer\n"
"\n"
"    Note: This endpoint only works for `contact_form` messages.\n"
"    For order notes, use the order notes reply endpoint instead.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Répondre à un message du client provenant du formulaire de contact.\n"
"\n"
"**Limite de taux :** 300 requêtes par minute\n"
"\n"
"**Format d'URL :** `/messages/contact_form/{id}/reply/`\n"
"\n"
"Ce point de terminaison :\n"
"1. Enregistre le texte de la réponse associé au message\n"
"2. Met à jour le statut du message sur 'répondu'\n"
"3. Envoie éventuellement un e-mail au client\n"
"\n"
"Remarque : Ce point de terminaison ne fonctionne qu'avec les messages `contact_form`.\n"
"Pour les notes de commande, utilisez le point de terminaison de réponse des notes de commande à la place.\n"
"    "

#: views/messages.py:952
msgid "Invalid reply data."
msgstr "Données de réponse invalides."

#: views/orders.py:47
msgid "List orders"
msgstr "Liste des commandes"

#: views/orders.py:48
#| msgid ""
#| "\n"
#| "    Get a paginated list of orders with filtering and sorting.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Filtering:**\n"
#| "    Use either `status` for a specific status or `filter_type` for status groups.\n"
#| "    If `status` is provided (not 'all'), `filter_type` is ignored.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Filter Types (groups):**\n"
#| "    - all: All orders (default)\n"
#| "    - open: Orders with status pending or processing\n"
#| "    - completed: Orders with status shipped or delivered\n"
#| "    - refunded: Orders with status refunded or cancelled\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Sort Options:**\n"
#| "    - -created_at: Newest first (default)\n"
#| "    - created_at: Oldest first\n"
#| "    - -total_amount: Highest value first\n"
#| "    - total_amount: Lowest value first\n"
#| "    "
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Get a paginated list of orders with filtering and sorting.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    **Filtering:**\n"
"    Use either `status` for a specific status or `filter_type` for status groups.\n"
"    If `status` is provided (not 'all'), `filter_type` is ignored.\n"
"\n"
"    **Filter Types (groups):**\n"
"    - all: All orders (default)\n"
"    - open: Orders with status pending or processing\n"
"    - completed: Orders with status shipped or delivered\n"
"    - refunded: Orders with status refunded or cancelled\n"
"\n"
"    **Sort Options:**\n"
"    - -created_at: Newest first (default)\n"
"    - created_at: Oldest first\n"
"    - -total_amount: Highest value first\n"
"    - total_amount: Lowest value first\n"
"    - -updated_at: Recently updated first\n"
"    - updated_at: Least recently updated first\n"
"    - customer_name: Customer name A-Z\n"
"    - -customer_name: Customer name Z-A\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Obtenir une liste paginée de commandes avec un filtrage et un tri.\n"
"\n"
"**Limite de taux :** 300 demandes par minute\n"
"\n"
"**Filtrage :**\n"
"Utilisez soit `status` pour un statut spécifique, soit `filter_type` pour des groupes de statuts.\n"
"Si `status` est fourni (et n'est pas 'all'), `filter_type` est ignoré.\n"
"\n"
"**Types de filtre (groupes) :**\n"
"- all : Toutes les commandes (par défaut)\n"
"- open : Commandes avec un statut en attente ou en cours de traitement\n"
"- completed : Commandes avec un statut expédié ou livré\n"
"- refunded : Commandes avec un statut remboursé ou annulé\n"
"\n"
"**Options de tri :**\n"
"- -created_at : Les plus récentes en premier (par défaut)\n"
"- created_at : Les plus anciennes en premier\n"
"- -total_amount : Les plus élevées en premier\n"
"- total_amount : Les plus basses en premier\n"
"- -updated_at : Les plus récemment mises à jour en premier\n"
"- updated_at : Les moins récemment mises à jour en premier\n"
"- customer_name : Nom du client A-Z\n"
"- -customer_name : Nom du client Z-A\n"
"    "

#: views/orders.py:79
msgid ""
"Filter type: 'all', 'open', 'completed', 'refunded'. Ignored if 'status' is "
"provided."
msgstr ""
"Type de filtre : 'all', 'open', 'completed', 'refunded'. Ignoré si 'status' "
"est fourni."

