#: views/products.py:57
msgid "List products"
msgstr "Liste des produits"

#: views/products.py:58
#| msgid ""
#| "\n"
#| "    Get a paginated list of products with filtering and sorting.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Stock Status Filter:**\n"
#| "    - all: All products (default)\n"
#| "    - in_stock: Products with available stock > low_stock_threshold\n"
#| "    - low_stock: Products with 0 < available stock <= low_stock_threshold\n"
#| "    - out_of_stock: Products with available stock <= 0\n"
#| "\n"
#| "    **Sort Options (use 'ordering' parameter):**\n"
#| "    - name: Name A-Z\n"
#| "    - -name: Name Z-A\n"
#| "    - -created_at: Newest first\n"
#| "    - created_at: Oldest first\n"
#| "    - stock_quantity: Lowest stock first\n"
#| "    - -stock_quantity: Highest stock first\n"
#| "    "
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Get a paginated list of products with filtering and sorting.\n"
"\n"
"    **Rate Limit:** 300 requests per minute\n"
"\n"
"    **Stock Status Filter:**\n"
"    - all: All products (default)\n"
"    - in_stock: Products with available stock > low_stock_threshold\n"
"    - low_stock: Products with 0 < available stock <= low_stock_threshold\n"
"    - out_of_stock: Products with available stock <= 0\n"
"\n"
"    **Sort Options (use 'ordering' parameter):**\n"
"    - name: Name A-Z\n"
"    - -name: Name Z-A\n"
"    - -created_at: Newest first\n"
"    - created_at: Oldest first\n"
"    - stock_quantity: Lowest stock first\n"
"    - -stock_quantity: Highest stock first\n"
"    - price: Price low to high\n"
"    - -price: Price high to low\n"
"    - -updated_at: Recently updated first\n"
"    - updated_at: Least recently updated first\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Obtenir une liste paginée de produits avec un filtrage et un tri.\n"
"\n"
"**Limite de taux :** 300 demandes par minute\n"
"\n"
"**Filtre d'état des stocks :**\n"
"- all : Tous les produits (par défaut)\n"
"- in_stock : Produits avec un stock disponible > seuil_de_stock_bas\n"
"- low_stock : Produits avec 0 < stock disponible <= seuil_de_stock_bas\n"
"- out_of_stock : Produits avec stock disponible <= 0\n"
"\n"
"**Options de tri (utilisez le paramètre 'ordering') :**\n"
"- name : Nom A-Z\n"
"- -name : Nom Z-A\n"
"- -created_at : Les plus récents en premier\n"
"- created_at : Les plus anciens en premier\n"
"- stock_quantity : Stock le plus bas en premier\n"
"- -stock_quantity : Stock le plus élevé en premier\n"
"- price : Prix du plus bas au plus élevé\n"
"- -price : Prix du plus élevé au plus bas\n"
"- -updated_at : Les plus récemment mis à jour en premier\n"
"- updated_at : Les moins récemment mis à jour en premier\n"
"    "

#: views/products.py:86
msgid "Filter by product status: 'all', 'draft', 'published', 'discontinued'"
msgstr ""
"Filtrer par statut du produit : 'all', 'draft', 'published', 'discontinued'"

